---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
  title="Jason Cusati — Fellowship Sprint Notebook"
  description="Public research notebook for Jason Cusati's Anthropic Fellows 2026 application sprint."
>
  <h1>Fellowship Sprint Notebook</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A public working notebook for my application to the <a
      href="https://www.anthropic.com/fellows-program"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">Anthropic Fellows Program</a
    > (October 2026 cohort). Started 2026-07-18.
  </p>

  <p>
    I keep this in the open because doing research work in public sharpens
    the work itself. What lives here: my day-by-day sprint plan and progress,
    a running reading list of the papers and posts I'm working through, and
    short notes on the Anthropic research teams whose work I'm most
    interested in.
  </p>

  <p>
    What does <em>not</em> live here: application-form drafts, reference
    strategy, self-assessment, percentages. Those are private for the same
    reason interview prep is: publishing them would be dishonest to the
    people doing the reviewing.
  </p>

  <h2>Sections</h2>
  <ul class="section-list">
    <li>
      <a href={`${base}fellowship-sprint/schedule`}>Sprint schedule &amp; progress</a>
      <span class="section-meta">— 10-day plan (2026-07-18 → 2026-07-27) with progress state</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={`${base}fellowship-sprint/reading`}>Reading list</a>
      <span class="section-meta">— papers and posts I'm working through, with brief takeaways</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={`${base}fellowship-sprint/team-notes`}>Team research notes</a>
      <span class="section-meta">— what specific Anthropic research directions I'm drawn to, and why</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Status</h2>
  <p>Sprint in progress. Pages fill in as I do the work.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .section-list li {
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-list a {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .section-meta {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
